Page
    Type: Page
    Role: Content
    Purpose: Full normative specification of the Semantic Interface Layer (SIL). This document is written in Semantic Text Format — it is both the specification and a conformant STF document demonstrating the format it defines. Developed with AIS Agora methodology — iterative review by flagship AI models with context passing.

    SILSpecification
        Type: Page
        Role: Content
        Purpose: Full normative specification of the Semantic Interface Layer (SIL).

        Version
            Type: Text
